  "name": "Acrobatic Assist (Ex)",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "subType": "classFeat",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A thief can expend an attack of opportunity to perform an aid another action to assist an adjacent ally's Acrobatics check, so long as he makes the check as part of movement that passes through the thief's space or an adjacent space. Additionally, whenever the thief uses the aid another action to assist an ally in making an Acrobatics check and she succeeds, her ally gains a +1 dodge bonus to AC against attacks of opportunity caused when he moves out of or within a threatened area, until the end of his turn.</p>",
